rgedocumentslegalblackline_0","displayName":"Disabled","dependedOnBy":[]},{"itemId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_toolscompareandmergedocumentslegalblackline_1","displayName":"Enabled","dependedOnBy":[]}]},{"@odata.type":"#microsoft.graph.deviceManagementConfigurationChoiceSettingDefinition","id":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_disablemrulistinfontdropdown","name":"L_DisableMRUlistinfontdropdown","displayName":"Disable MRU list in font dropdown (User)","description":"This policy allows you to hide the list of recently used fonts found under Home tab | Font.\r\n\r\nIf you enable this policy setting, the list of recently used fonts will not be shown.\r\n\r\nIf you disable or do not configure this policy setting, the list of recently used fonts will be shown.","categoryId":"320ccaa3-a391-4d29-a9c4-594561f4104d","baseUri":"./User/Vendor/MSFT/Policy","offsetUri":"/Config/word16v2~Policy~L_MicrosoftOfficeWord~L_miscellaneous178/L_DisableMRUlistinfontdropdown","rootDefinitionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_disablemrulistinfontdropdown","uxBehavior":"toggle","applicability":{"platform":"windows10","technologies":"mdm"},"defaultOptionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_disablemrulistinfontdropdown_0","options":[{"itemId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_disablemrulistinfontdropdown_0","displayName":"Disabled","dependedOnBy":[]},{"itemId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_disablemrulistinfontdropdown_1","displayName":"Enabled","dependedOnBy":[]}]},{"@odata.type":"#microsoft.graph.deviceManagementConfigurationSettingGroupCollectionDefinition","id":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_listofmanagedaddins_l_listofmanagedaddins2","name":"L_ListOfManagedAddins2","displayName":"List of managed add-ins (User)","categoryId":"320ccaa3-a391-4d29-a9c4-594561f4104d","baseUri":"./User/Vendor/MSFT/Policy","offsetUri":"/Config/word16v2~Policy~L_MicrosoftOfficeWord~L_miscellaneous178/L_ListOfManagedAddins","rootDefinitionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_listofmanagedaddins","uxBehavior":"default","applicability":{"platform":"windows10","technologies":"mdm"},"dependedOnBy":[{"dependedOnBy":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_listofmanagedaddins_l_listofmanagedaddins2_key","required":true},{"dependedOnBy":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_listofmanagedaddins_l_listofmanagedaddins2_value","required":true}]},{"@odata.type":"#microsoft.graph.deviceManagementConfigurationChoiceSettingDefinition","id":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_blockallunmanagedaddins","name":"L_BlockAllUnmanagedAddins","displayName":"Block all unmanaged add-ins (User)","description":"This policy setting blocks all add-ins that are not managed by the \"List of managed add-ins\" policy setting.\r\n\r\nIf you enable this policy setting, and the \"List of managed add-ins\" policy setting is also enabled, all add-ins are blocked except those that are configured as 1 (always enabled) or 2 (configurable by the user) in the \"List of managed add-ins\" policy setting.\r\n\r\nIf you disable or do not configure this policy setting, users can enable or disable any add-ins that are not managed by the \"List of managed add-ins\" policy setting.","categoryId":"320ccaa3-a391-4d29-a9c4-594561f4104d","baseUri":"./User/Vendor/MSFT/Policy","offsetUri":"/Config/word16v2~Policy~L_MicrosoftOfficeWord~L_miscellaneous178/L_BlockAllUnmanagedAddins","rootDefinitionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_blockallunmanagedaddins","uxBehavior":"toggle","applicability":{"platform":"windows10","technologies":"mdm"},"defaultOptionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_blockallunmanagedaddins_0","options":[{"itemId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_blockallunmanagedaddins_0","displayName":"Disabled","dependedOnBy":[]},{"itemId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_blockallunmanagedaddins_1","displayName":"Enabled","dependedOnBy":[]}]},{"@odata.type":"#microsoft.graph.deviceManagementConfigurationSimpleSettingDefinition","id":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_personaltemplatespath_l_personaltemplatespath","name":"L_PersonalTemplatesPath","displayName":"Personal templates path (User)","categoryId":"320ccaa3-a391-4d29-a9c4-594561f4104d","baseUri":"./User/Vendor/MSFT/Policy","offsetUri":"/Config/word16v2~Policy~L_MicrosoftOfficeWord~L_miscellaneous178/L_PersonalTemplatesPath","rootDefinitionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_personaltemplatespath","uxBehavior":"default","applicability":{"platform":"windows10","technologies":"mdm"},"dependedOnBy":[]},{"@odata.type":"#microsoft.graph.deviceManagementConfigurationChoiceSettingDefinition","id":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_donotuseonlinetranslationdictionaries","name":"L_DoNotUseOnlineTranslationDictionaries","displayName":"Use online translation dictionaries (User)","description":"This policy setting allows you to prevent online dictionaries from being used for the translation of text through the Research pane.\r\n\r\nIf you enable or do not configure this policy setting, the online dictionaries can be used to translate text through the Research pane.\r\n\r\nIf you disable this policy setting, the online dictionaries cannot be used to translate text through the Research pane.","categoryId":"320ccaa3-a391-4d29-a9c4-594561f4104d","baseUri":"./User/Vendor/MSFT/Policy","offsetUri":"/Config/word16v2~Policy~L_MicrosoftOfficeWord~L_miscellaneous178/L_DoNotUseOnlineTranslationDictionaries","rootDefinitionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_donotuseonlinetranslationdictionaries","uxBehavior":"toggle","applicability":{"platform":"windows10","technologies":"mdm"},"defaultOptionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_donotuseonlinetranslationdictionaries_0","options":[{"itemId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_donotuseonlinetranslationdictionaries_0","displayName":"Disabled","dependedOnBy":[]},{"itemId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_donotuseonlinetranslationdictionaries_1","displayName":"Enabled","dependedOnBy":[]}]},{"@odata.type":"#microsoft.graph.deviceManagementConfigurationChoiceSettingDefinition","id":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_disableofficestartword","name":"L_DisableOfficeStartWord","displayName":"Disable the Office Start screen for Word (User)","description":"This policy setting controls whether the Office Start screen appears on boot for Word.\r\n\r\nIf you enable this policy setting, users will not see the Office Start screen when they boot Word.\r\n\r\nIf you disable or do not configure this policy setting, users will see the Office Start screen when they boot Word.\r\n\r\nNote: This policy setting is overridden by the policy setting \"Microsoft Office 2016 > Miscellaneous > Disable the Office Start screen for all Office applications\" if that policy setting is set.","categoryId":"320ccaa3-a391-4d29-a9c4-594561f4104d","baseUri":"./User/Vendor/MSFT/Policy","offsetUri":"/Config/word16v2~Policy~L_MicrosoftOfficeWord~L_miscellaneous178/L_DisableOfficeStartWord","rootDefinitionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_disableofficestartword","uxBehavior":"toggle","applicability":{"platform":"windows10","technologies":"mdm"},"defaultOptionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_disableofficestartword_0","options":[{"itemId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_disableofficestartword_0","displayName":"Disabled","dependedOnBy":[]},{"itemId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_word16v2~policy~l_microsoftofficeword~l_miscellaneous178_l_disableofficestartword_1","displayName":"Enabled","dependedOnBy":[]}]}]